{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X 的感受词有时堆得偏密，个别意象略抽象，Y 的完整长句在少数地方因果衔接更自然。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 把人物心思拆成短而完整的步骤，加亮词能让观众迅速抓住每段的心理转折；感受词又有一部分跟着音乐节点出现，不必一次处理整串信息。Y 的完整句子更容易读出因果关系，但右侧感受词常常同时堆积，部分用词如「情欲」「情色」也让细腻的亲近感显得偏粗。整体而言，X 更能让普通观众边听边跟住人物从试探、沉醉、害怕失去到接受不确定的完整变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d148be1f-2d5f-4142-90f2-fc1936955dd3", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T193228458558Z", "elapsed_seconds": 126.985, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T19:34:35.448155+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "afb05eedf9aad9ca746883a09eb8d31f1d4a13edbbcd75b5f12a2733810ac1dd", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa2